# Not written:
#   DNS out on private networks: 'DNS' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   SMB from the local subnet: 'LocalSubnet' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   SSH from the IPv6 jump hosts: no IPv4 address as the source
#   Echo request (ICMPv4-In): its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   Echo request (ICMPv6-In): its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   Fragmentation needed and time exceeded: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   SNMP from the local subnet: its services cannot be written: source ports: a service of Cato has destination ports only
#   GRE from the tunnel peer: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   SSDP discovery: 'LocalSubnet' holds members whose addresses are not known
